# [Project Name] — Development Tracker [CUSTOMIZE]

> **How to use this file**
> - **Session start** — read this first; understand the Active Sprint before touching code (`/prime`).
> - **`/orchestrator`** — parses the first incomplete `[ ]` task in the Active Sprint.
> - **Sprint promote/close** — handled by `/lean-doc-generator promote` and `/lean-doc-generator close`.
> - **Sprint completed** — move the closed sprint block to `docs/CHANGELOG.md` (prepend, newest first), then delete it from here.

> **Sprint sizing**
> - 2–5 tasks per sprint. Never plan a sprint with a single task.
> - Order by dependency first, then importance + urgency.
> - Promote from Backlog in priority order (P0 → P3); remove promoted tasks from Backlog immediately.

